  "story": {
    "text": "In Year 6, Tinki of Kiangratheth and Tath of Gelheil fell out over the clash of a cruel nature with a kind one. In Year 11, at Greindrondcross, Tath of Gelheil sprang an ambush on Tinki of Kiangratheth, and they fight to the death; the clash goes on, its end yet to come. In Year 12, at Greindrondcross, Tath of Gelheil met Tinki of Kiangratheth to the death. Tath of Gelheil won, and Tinki of Kiangratheth was slain. That same year, Tinki of Kiangratheth was killed in a duel, aged 51. In Year 19, Hebiand of Kiangratheth called Tath of Gelheil out (to first blood); they will meet at Greindrondcross in a year and a day. And so, in Year 20, at Greindrondcross, Hebiand of Kiangratheth met Tath of Gelheil to first blood. Tath of Gelheil drew first blood and won.",
